# The generator and its inputs are not the site.
# `index.html`, `fr/index.html`, `shots/` and `favicon.svg` are what gets
# served; everything below is how they are produced, or the variant meant for
# a host that blocks external images. Shipping them would put two 2.4 MB
# duplicates of the page, the build script and the catalogues on a public URL
# for nothing.
build.sh
build.py
page.src.html
page.html
page.fr.html
i18n/
